      "widgets_values": ["=== SVI 2.0 Pro Workflow ===\n\nThis workflow implements proper SVI motion latent passing between clips.\n\n📌 HOW TO ADD MORE CLIPS:\n1. Select all nodes in the 'CLIP 2' group (Ctrl+click or box select)\n2. Duplicate them (Ctrl+D)\n3. Move the duplicated group below\n4. Connect the 'motion_latent' output from previous clip's\n   'Extract Motion Latent' node to the new clip's\n   'WanVideoAddExtraLatent' extra_latents input\n5. Update the seed number (increment by 1)\n6. Connect the decode output to video concatenation\n\n📌 KEY PARAMETERS:\n- steps: 20 (or 4-8 with LightX2V at full strength)\n- HIGH sampler: steps 0-10\n- LOW sampler: steps 10-end\n- num_motion_latent: 1 (4 pixel frames)\n- boundary: 0.9 for I2V\n\n📌 LORA NOTES:\n- SVI LoRAs: Required for motion continuity\n- LightX2V: Optional speedup (set alpha=0 to disable)"],
      "title": "📖 INSTRUCTIONS"
    },

